---
// Locks the docs to the dark theme. The tauler design system has no light
// theme (a known gap in the design draft), so the default ThemeProvider's
// localStorage/system-preference logic is replaced with a constant.
// With JS disabled Starlight's base CSS is dark by default, so this
// degrades correctly.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark'
</script>
